      "content": "thanks. can u add a bit more detail to the second paragraph though? i want to be super clear that these changes will be totally unpredictable. like, the temp might suddenly spike or drop for no reason at all while the techs are working. i want to make sure tenants don't think the system is being sabotaged or that something is actually wrong, just that it's gonna be a bit erratic for a few hours. can u word that so it sounds professional but emphasizes how random the shifts will be?",
